==English==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|frm|incongruité}}, from {{der|en|ML.|incongruitās}}, from {{der|en|la|incongruus}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GA}} {{IPA|en|/ɪnkɑŋˈɡɹuɪti/}}
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|en|/ɪnkɒŋˈɡɹuːɪti/}}
* {{hyph|en|in|con|gru|i|ty}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# The state of being [[incongruous]], or lacking [[congruence]].
# An instance or point of [[disagreement]]
#: {{syn|en|dissimilarity|discrepancy|inconsistency}}
# A thing that is [[incongruous]].

